Subject: [PATCH 4/9] selftests: authority: cover filesystem lifecycle and
 acquisition

Record the qualified core/filesystem, idmapped, callback, acquisition, DAC-FD and handle regression sources. Registration and runner arrive after all referenced test sources are present.
